OL,3,APilots taken to hospital after reported
OL,4,Acockpit stabbing on Israel-bound flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers say a pilot on a Dubai to
OL,7,FTel Aviv flight was stabbed before the
OL,8,Fplane was diverted to Saudi Arabia -
OL,9,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,11,FThe airport where the plane landed says
OL,12,Fboth the captain and first officer
OL,13,Fsustained injuries - but does not say
OL,14,Fhow. Both have been taken to hospital
OL,16,FOne video shows a passenger on board
OL,17,Fthe plane as it approached Saudi
OL,18,FArabia: "Anyone who hears me: we need
OL,19,Fhelp"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
