OL,3,APilots taken to hospital after reported
OL,4,Acockpit stabbing on Israel-bound flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother passenger says "we took control
OL,7,Fof the flight" from "an assailant with
OL,8,Fa knife" - while two other pilots,
OL,9,Fsitting at the back, reportedly came
OL,10,Fforward to land the plane
OL,12,FThe Flydubai plane signalled an
OL,13,Femergency code two hours into the
OL,14,Fflight. It then switched to a hijacking
OL,15,Fcode but returned to a general
OL,16,Femergency signal
OL,18,FData shows how the plane plummeted
OL,19,F17,000ft (5,200m) in less than two
OL,20,Fminutes
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
